    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d572">

                <pb facs="0814" n="718" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg718"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to the
                            President.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-03-29"><hi rendition="#italic">March 29,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>No. 60. Have had conference this afternoon, Tuesday, with the president of the
                    council, the minister for foreign affairs, and minister for colonies. Conference
                    adjourned until Thursday afternoon, March 31. I have sincere belief that
                    arrangement will then be reached, honorable to Spain and satisfactory to the
                    United States, and just to Cuba. I beg you to withhold all action until you
                    receive my report of such conference, which I will send Thursday night, March
                    31.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
